.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
.TH "FSPROOF" "1" "2026-11-12" "passerelle 0.1.0" "Passerelle host tools"
.SH NAME
fsproof \- Filesystem conformance bench: differential, content, directed
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fsproof
.RI [ OPTION ]...
.I COMMAND
.RI [ COMMAND\-OPTION ]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Filesystem conformance bench: differential, content, directed (7.2\-7.4)
.P
fsproof is the filesystem conformance bench of sections 7.2\-7.4 of the
specification: `diff` replays a seeded pseudo\-random operation sequence
against the PC truth and stores every divergence as a regression case,
`exercise` runs the content exerciser of section 7.3, `cases` runs the
directed cases of section 7.4, and `clients` lists the client profiles that
can be put under test.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-client\fR \fICLIENT\fR
client under test (eclipse, passerelle, qnx\-fs\-9p) (default: configuration
'client' = 'passerelle')
.TP
\fB\-\-show\-config\fR \fIFORMAT\fR
print the effective configuration (text or json) and exit (choices: text,
json)
.SS fsproof diff
.TP
\fBdiff\fR
seeded differential test against the PC truth
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-seed\fR \fISEED\fR
seed of the sequence (default: configuration 'seed' = '1')
.TP
\fB\-\-count\fR \fICOUNT\fR
number of operations (default: configuration 'count' = '200')
.TP
\fB\-\-local\fR
replay on the PC, no guest
.TP
\fB\-\-guest\-cmd\fR \fIGUEST_CMD\fR
guest agent command, e.g. 'qrun \-\-console /tmp/ser.sock'
.TP
\fB\-\-regressions\fR \fIREGRESSIONS\fR
regression directory (default: configuration 'regressions' = 'regressions')
.TP
\fB\-\-replay\fR \fIFILE\fR
replay a stored regression case
.TP
\fB\-\-mtime\-slack\fR \fIMTIME_SLACK\fR
tolerated mtime drift in seconds (default: 0.0)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fIFILE\fR
also write the result as JSON
.SS fsproof exercise
.TP
\fBexercise\fR
content exerciser (7.3)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-dir\fR \fIDIR\fR
directory to exercise (default: temporary)
.TP
\fB\-\-ops\fR \fIOPS\fR
operations per run (default: configuration 'ops' = '10000')
.TP
\fB\-\-workers\fR \fIWORKERS\fR
concurrent workers (default: configuration 'workers' = '1')
.TP
\fB\-\-shared\fR
all workers on one file
.TP
\fB\-\-plan\fR
run the three shapes of 7.3
.TP
\fB\-\-seed\fR \fIEXERCISE_SEED\fR
seed of the exerciser (default: configuration 'exercise\-seed' = '2026')
.SS fsproof cases
.TP
\fBcases\fR
directed cases of section 7.4
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-\-dir\fR \fIDIR\fR
working directory (default: temporary)
.TP
\fB\-\-slow\fR
include the 100 000\-entry directory
.TP
\fB\-\-only\fR \fIONLY\fR
run only this case (repeatable)
.SS fsproof clients
.TP
\fBclients\fR
list the client profiles
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
\fB0\fR
every check passed
.TP
\fB1\fR
at least one divergence, regression or directed case failed
.TP
\fB2\fR
usage error or host environment error
.SH FILES
.TP
\fIregressions/\fR
divergence cases stored by `diff` (\-\-regressions)
.TP
\fI\-\-json FILE\fR
optional JSON result of `diff`
.SH SEE ALSO
qshare(1), qrun(1), pbench(1)
